{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：20:45 2026-10-20 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Ahyo郭曉妍貼身裙成焦點拒透露身形數字 Yanny劉綺婷向麥沛東撒嬌反被模仿搞到忍笑。。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl_square/b08fb4a938dfbf4e4d6f8d00a6e0b281/2026-10/cats3_9.jpg\"/>\n<p>郭曉妍（Ahyo）與劉綺婷（Yanny）兩位女團Lolly Talk成員齊齊現身「火力全HOY」十月新排陣記者會，二人同樣參演《你的保安 李寶安》，Yanny透露劇中與麥沛東有很多對手戲，經常被對方逗笑，劇中她要向對方撒嬌，麥沛東反過來模仿她，令她演出是要吃力忍笑，問是否過電？她指麥沛東已婚，但將來可能有感情線。</p>\n<img alt=\"Lolly Talk成員郭曉妍（Ahyo）與劉綺婷（Yanny）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c7fb644ca77792bcbabaf2b46d2bee2c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉綺婷（Yanny）演《你的保安 李寶安》與麥沛東有很多對手戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/51ea82a2e2f31421ef4c93662fefb309/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_08_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人有份演出《你的保安 李寶安》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d39427804accca057bb17d0de3beb3a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_08.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"郭曉妍（Ahyo）與魏浚笙演情侶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3e0a49c28317239efacffee7a4bc6c9f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_12.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ahyo與Yanny互相支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e43aeb617a94da0161716a4709b80c0e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_15.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ahyo身材呼之欲出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2eea15bcb92e31c70531d9822755c91a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_21_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"二人一齊派心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0d006151d1ddf85c3f88b6b641975d0d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_21.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Yanny與麥沛東冇感情戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7039aa99121db8b7c734704f528928ab/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_23_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姚正菁及吳綺莉現身支持伍詠薇主持的《九運會客室2》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cf14a9af61940395b82539e945021424/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_41_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《九運會客室2》主持人出席記者會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a3138796f3786aa2b7100556ede19d5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳綺莉激罕現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9dcd6526ecf1327fd9024407014ea76e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-20_at_16_16_42_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Ahyo郭曉妍拒透露身形數字。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6cbf3963e2a5269cc275c62f4960ddfc/2026-10/thumbnail_1__7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Lolly Talk接受商演。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1c12365c8013ae977f6948ef82be0ae9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-04_at_19_03_11_1__0.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>郭曉妍與魏浚笙演情侶冇身體接觸戲份</h2>\n<p>至於Ahyo指魏浚笙演其男朋友，不過二人沒身體接觸的戲份，談到他在友台《地獄大狀》經常騷肌好搶眼，會否覺得不公平？她笑言今日只講HOYTV，但希望導演將來考慮到這一點，演出安排都交給導演，將來有親密戲也不介意，自認是「螢幕A0」。</p>\n<h2>郭曉妍有做Gym習慣</h2>\n<p>談到Ahyo早前以貼身裙出席活動，身形呼之欲出成為話題，她稱：「多謝大家，不過不用太關注身材，但我有努力保持身型，因為都想靚，有做Gym習慣。」她又拒絕透露身形數字，「唔知數字，因為數字時大時小，是Keep住變！」至於Lolly Talk會否再齊人合體？她們稱要視有否人邀請商演，若有機會也會度期合體。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:49.792730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":480,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:45:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:57.566625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:46.146355+00:00","content_hash":"c3060ca7fa9624860ae7871ee3498922cfe7f1301dac506f18a0daedb03eeb4e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}